  },
  {
    topic: "Selling food",
    rule: "FSSAI's order of 13 March 2026 sets FSSAI registration for food businesses with turnover up to Rs 1.5 crore, from 1 April 2026. Registration and licences are now valid without a fixed end date, subject to inspections.",
