  { q: "Which business ideas for students can scale into something bigger?", a: "Those that sell a skill with proof: video editing, design, social media and websites for local shops. You can package the work at a fixed price, add helpers and later build a small studio. Tutoring, notes and handmade goods can scale if you add a course, a bundle or a brand. Time-for-money jobs like local tech help are Not so scalable on their own." },
